  Slug: nine-lives-catfolk
  DisplayName: Nine Lives Catfolk
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/ancestry/nine-lives-catfolk.webp
  Description: Your family has always seems to bounce back from disaster, not through
    physical hardiness or specialized skill, but from sheer luck. Other catfolk whisper
    that you have nine lives. While you're @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dying],
    you don't add your dying value to the DC of your recovery checks (this means
    the DC is typically 10). In addition, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Diehard]
    general feat.
